OL,3,ABurnham rejects calls for devolution of
OL,4,Apowers in letter to Welsh FM
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has rejected
OL,7,Flong-standing calls from the first
OL,8,Fminister of Wales for certain powers to
OL,9,Fbe transferred from Westminster to
OL,10,FCardiff.
OL,12,FIn a letter to Rhun ap Iorwerth, Andy
OL,13,FBurnham said he was "not persuaded" by
OL,14,Fthe case to devolve responsibilities
OL,15,Fover policing and justice, the Crown
OL,16,FEstate and rail infrastructure to
OL,17,FWales.
OL,19,FThe first minister accused the prime
OL,20,Fminister of "turning his back on
OL,21,Fdevolution" and not viewing Wales as an
OL,22,F"equal nation".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
